{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56168","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 八 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辛未年，种植近山边。\n初春有大水，夏中必旱然。\n吴地应无事，荆楚被灾缠。\n夏首虽微旱，秋泉遍满源。\n不免鱼灾起，家家被率牵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}